  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Probability that box&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is selected <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Probability that box&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is selected <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;the event that one ball is white while the other is red.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow/><mn>7</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow/><mn>9</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>21</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>63</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>63</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
